        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn ALEBP, Forged Iron Iron Vertical Cane Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Acorn, this Vertical Cane Door Bolt is often used on barn doors, storage room doors, and on garden gates. It can be used on interior and exterior doors. The 3 square guide plates make this a very sturdy and decorative design. It has a smooth black finish; and it is packaged with mounting screws and strike. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor over a half a century authenticity and function have been the way Acorn Manufacturing has produced some of the highest quality forged hardware and accessories for your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 22 Inch Cane Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Smooth Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 22-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Shape: Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b>\r\n</p>",
